# The firmware package binary is a published release asset, not something this
# branch should carry: 6.6MB in a firmware repo forever, for a file that already
# lives on the release and in the registry pull request.
#
# Reconstitute the exact package with:
#
#   gh release download v1.12.11 --repo ma-r-s/crossplay \
#     --pattern 'crossplay-v1.12.11-sticky-full.bin' \
#     --dir playground-submission/firmwares/crossplay/firmware/1.12.11/
#
# The manifest beside it records the size and SHA-256 to check it against.
*.bin
